#: ../../source/libraries/data/list_world.md:3
msgid ""
"`ListWorld` visualizes a list of numeric values as a row of vertical "
"bars. Each bar's height is proportional to its value. Use it to animate "
"sorting and search algorithms step by step."
msgstr ""

